- Upgraded the gorilla/mux OpenTelemetry instrumentation to v0.71.0. HTTP server metrics for gorilla-routed requests now use the stable semantic conventions: `http.server.request.duration` in seconds replaces `http.server.duration` in milliseconds, and `http.server.request.body.size` and `http.server.response.body.size` replace `http.server.request.size` and `http.server.response.size`. Dashboards or alerts built on the old metric names need to be updated.
